<http://data.europa.eu/a4g/resource/d1f9185a-3388-4864-b001-79551d0c6e14-01/SelectionCriterion$_ContractNotice1_ProcurementProjectLot1_TenderingTerms1_UBLExtensions1_UBLExtension1_ExtensionContent1_EformsExtension1_SelectionCriteria6>
